*  undefined.sno -- call a function that was never defined.
*  ERRORS: NOSUCH is not a function of this SNOBOL4 and no DEFINE
*  makes it one, so the compiler accepts the call and the interpreter
*  finds out at run time. Error 5.
*  Part of github.com/mdhender/sil. BSD 2-Clause; see LICENSE.
*
*  The program compiles clean, which is the point: a name is only a
*  name until something asks it to be a function.
-LIST
        OUTPUT = 'before'
        OUTPUT = NOSUCH(1)
        OUTPUT = 'after'
END
